### Healthcare Payment Gateway - reconciliation (operations only)
### Prerequisites: the stack with --profile recon, and an OPS token:
###   curl -s -u "ops-console:$HPG_OPS_CLIENT_SECRET" -d grant_type=client_credentials localhost:8080/oauth2/token
### Sample settlement files: samples/settlement/ (README explains each). scripts/smoke-test-phase6.sh runs all of this.

@gw = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Upload a provider settlement CSV for a business date -> 202 + Location of the batch.
###    The same file again -> 409 DUPLICATE_SETTLEMENT_FILE (SHA-256 of the content).
POST {{gw}}/api/v1/reconciliation/settlement-files?businessDate={{businessDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=hpg

--hpg
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="discrepancies.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../settlement/discrepancies.csv
--hpg--

### 2. Or reconcile against the Razorpay settlement API (needs Razorpay keys; 422 with the simulated provider)
POST {{gw}}/api/v1/reconciliation/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "businessDate": "{{businessDate}}" }

### 3. Poll the batch until COMPLETED: counts per status
GET {{gw}}/api/v1/reconciliation/batches/{{batchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### 4. Open discrepancies of a batch (MATCHED, AMOUNT_MISMATCH, MISSING_IN_PROVIDER, MISSING_IN_INTERNAL_SYSTEM,
###    DUPLICATE, ...)
GET {{gw}}/api/v1/reconciliation/batches/{{batchId}}/records?resolutionStatus=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### 5. Take one into review, then resolve it. Resolving changes the reconciliation record only, never money.
POST {{gw}}/api/v1/reconciliation/records/{{recordId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

###
POST {{gw}}/api/v1/reconciliation/records/{{recordId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resolutionType": "TIMING_DIFFERENCE", "note": "Settled in the next day's report" }

### 6. Daily report (JSON, or CSV with Accept: text/csv)
GET {{gw}}/api/v1/reconciliation/reports/daily?date={{businessDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}
Accept: text/csv

### 7. A hospital token is refused (403): reconciliation is an operations function
GET {{gw}}/api/v1/reconciliation/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
